====Taxi plates phase-out====
The provincial government ceased the issuance of T plates on October 10, 2020, and phased out T plates on October 13, 2020, and March 31, 2021, following the enactment of a law to modernize the taxi industry.<ref name="auto">{{cite web |title=Modernisation de l'industrie du taxi |url=https://www.transports.gouv.qc.ca/fr/taxi/Pages/default.aspx |work=Transports Québec |language=fr |publisher=Gouvernement du Québec |access-date=18 October 2020}}</ref> All T plates have been converted to either regular or commercial (F) plates.<ref name="auto1">{{cite web |title=Transport rémunéré de personnes par automobile: obligations et échéances |url=https://www.transports.gouv.qc.ca/fr/entreprises-partenaires/trpa/Documents/trpa/TRPA-Napperon-Obligations-echeance.pdf |work=Transports Québec |language=fr |publisher=Gouvernement du Québec |access-date=18 October 2020}}</ref>

